### ==========================================
### JDBC CONTROLLERS (RAW JDBC & JDBCTEMPLATE)
### ==========================================

### ------------------------------------------
### 1. ALBUM JDBC CONTROLLERS
### ------------------------------------------

### Create Album (Raw JDBC)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/raw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Raw Album Title",
  "releaseYear": 2024,
  "artistId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Get All Albums (Raw JDBC)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/raw

### Get Album by ID (Raw JDBC)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/raw/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Update Album (Raw JDBC)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/raw/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Raw Album",
  "releaseYear": 2025,
  "artistId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Delete Album (Raw JDBC)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/raw/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ---

### Create Album (JdbcTemplate)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/albums/template
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Template Album Title",
  "releaseYear": 2024,
  "artistId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Get All Albums (JdbcTemplate)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/template

### Get Album by ID (JdbcTemplate)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/template/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Update Album (JdbcTemplate)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/template/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Template Album",
  "releaseYear": 2025,
  "artistId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Delete Album (JdbcTemplate)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/template/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


