### ------------------------------------------
### 3. TRACK JDBC CONTROLLERS
### ------------------------------------------

### Create Track (Raw JDBC)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/raw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Blinding Lights",
  "durationSeconds": 200,
  "genreName": "Pop",
  "albumId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Get All Tracks (Raw JDBC)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/raw

### Get Track by ID (Raw JDBC)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/raw/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Update Track (Raw JDBC)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/raw/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Blinding Lights (Remix)",
  "durationSeconds": 210,
  "genreName": "Pop",
  "albumId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Delete Track (Raw JDBC)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/raw/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ---

### Create Track (JdbcTemplate)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/template
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Save Your Tears",
  "durationSeconds": 215,
  "genreName": "Pop",
  "albumId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Get All Tracks (JdbcTemplate)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/template

### Get Track by ID (JdbcTemplate)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/template/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Update Track (JdbcTemplate)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/template/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Save Your Tears (Remix)",
  "durationSeconds": 220,
  "genreName": "Pop",
  "albumId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Delete Track (JdbcTemplate)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/template/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


